      "snippet": "Self-fix: always pass `timeout` >= 60 for `openclaw` CLI commands, >= 30 for other commands when calling exec. The 15s default kills anything that takes a moment to start up. ## Security Audit (continued from Apr 14) - Ran `openclaw security audit --deep` (first full scan since Mar 5) - Critical fix applied: set `tools.deny = [\"web_search\", \"web_fetch\", \"browser\"]` on all 22 agents (heartbeat-llama already had it) - Warnings accepted as informational (single-user, local-only gateway) - Gateway restart needed to apply the tools.deny changes (was SIGKILLed during restart attempt) ## QMD Investigation - Duane asked about installing QMD in OpenClaw environment - QMD = @tobilu/qmd (v2.1.0), on-",
