      "snippet": "# 2026-04-18 ## Morning - Action items morning summary cron ran, delivered to Discord channel 1478745338696302785 - Summary: 12 open actions (Duane), 2 pending, 5 others open, 1 others pending - Note: Long Discord messages via `openclaw message send` get SIGKILL (likely timeout); shorter messages work fine ## SIGKILL Fix Root cause: OpenClaw exec tool defaults to 15s timeout. Commands exceeding 15s (like `openclaw status`, `openclaw gateway restart`, long `openclaw message send`) get SIGKILLed. No config key to change the default; timeout must be passed per-tool-call. Fixes applied: - Morning-summary cron (`action-items:morning-summary`): switched from `ollama/llama3.2:3b` to `google/gemi",
