      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "- Hermes on Mac mini: container issue was resolved by recreating the Docker container with `gateway run` and restoring Telegram env vars. The durable fix is to keep `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` and `TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS` in `~/.hermes/.env` so a container recreate does not lose them. - OpenClaw/Ollama provider investigation findings: - Global config and main-agent allowlists were partially misaligned. Explicit allowed model entries were needed for `ollama-gigabyte/*` and `ollama-cloud/*` models. - Main agent runtime metadata file `~/.openclaw/agents/main/agent/models.json` contained malformed/duplicate Ollama provider entries (`ollama`, `ollama_cloud`, etc.). Cleanup was performed to keep the",
